msgctxt "88_Akiyama"
msgid "Well? Want another go-round?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿qué opina? ¿Quiere intentarlo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "100_Scout from Another Club"
msgid "Dammit..."
msgstr "Maldición..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "136_Akiyama"
msgid "Sorry. I didn't mean to scare you."
msgstr "Perdóneme, no quería asustarla."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "148_Impressionable Woman"
msgid "It's okay... You sure are strong."
msgstr "Está bien... Parece ser alguien fuerte."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "160_Akiyama"
msgid "In my business, I have to be. Anyway, what do you think\\r\nabout the hostess job?"
msgstr "¡Lo soy! Para este tipo de trabajos se necesitan músculos.\nEn fin, ¿le gustaría trabajar en nuestro club?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "172_Impressionable Woman"
msgid "I've never worked at a hostess club before... I wonder if I'd\\r\nbe any good."
msgstr "Pues, nunca trabajé en un club de hostess... Me pregunto si\nlo haré bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "184_Akiyama"
msgid "You'll be fine as long as you keep motivated and focus on\\r\ncustomer service. Why not try it out for a day?"
msgstr "¡No se preocupe! Sé que lo hará bien y los clientes estarán\nsatisfechos. Debería intentarlo algún día."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "196_Impressionable Woman"
msgid "All right, I will."
msgstr "Está bien, lo intentaré."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "208_Akiyama"
msgid "Excellent! Here's my card. Could I get your cell phone\\r\nnumber?"
msgstr "¡Genial! Tome mi tarjeta. ¿Me permite su número de teléfono?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "220_Impressionable Woman"
msgid "Sure. Thanks for the opportunity."
msgstr "Con gusto. Muchas gracias por esta oportunidad."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "244_Akiyama"
msgid "All right, then. I'll be in touch!"
msgstr "Muy bien entonces, me pondré en contacto con usted."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "304_Akiyama"
msgid "Hi there. I'm a scout for a hostess club. Any interest?"
msgstr "Mucho gusto, trabajo como cazatalentos en un club de hostess. ¿Está interesada?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "316_Impressionable Woman"
msgid "A hostess club?"
msgstr "¿Club de hostess?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "328_Akiyama"
msgid "That's right! You're a real beauty. I bet you'd be pretty\\r\npopular."
msgstr "¡Así es! Usted es una verdadera belleza, seguro se\nhará popular en un abrir y cerrar de ojos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "340_Impressionable Woman"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Mmm..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "352_Scout from Another Club"
msgid "Hey, just whaddya think you're doing on my turf?"
msgstr "¡Alto ahí! Amigo, este es mi territorio, lárgate."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "364_Akiyama"
msgid "What? This isn't anybody's turf! You trying to start\\r\nsomething?"
msgstr "¡Oye, cálmate! Este no es territorio de nadie.\n¿O acaso quieres “charlar”?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "376_Scout from Another Club"
msgid "Shut your trap and get lost!"
msgstr "¡Cierra la puta boca, infeliz!"

